RetailMart – Retail Sales & Profit Performance Analysis
📊 Project Overview

This project presents an end-to-end Retail Sales & Profit Performance Analysis using Microsoft Excel.

The objective was to transform raw retail transaction data into meaningful business insights through data cleaning, calculations, Pivot Table analysis, KPI development, and an interactive dashboard.

🎯 Business Problem

RetailMart wants to understand:

Which regions generate the highest sales and profit?
Which products and categories perform best?
Which products have high sales but low profitability?
How do discounts affect profit margins?
Which months have the strongest and weakest performance?
Which payment methods contribute most to sales?
Which areas require management attention?
