🧹 Data Cleaning

The dataset was checked for:

Duplicate Order IDs
Missing values
Blank dates
Invalid dates
Future dates
Invalid quantities
Discounts below 0%
Discounts above 100%
Extra spaces
Inconsistent text values

The purpose was to ensure that the analysis was based on reliable and consistent data.

🧮 Calculations

The following calculated fields were created.

Gross Sales
Quantity × Unit Price
Discount Amount
Gross Sales × Discount
Net Sales
Gross Sales − Discount Amount
Profit
Net Sales − Cost
Profit Margin %
Profit ÷ Net Sales
Order Month

Transactions were converted into month-year format:

Jan-2026
Feb-2026
Mar-2026
...
Sales Band
Low       < ₹2,000
Medium    ₹2,000–₹5,000
High      > ₹5,000
Profit Status
Profit ≥ 0  → Profitable
Profit < 0  → Loss
