💡 Business Insights

The analysis focuses on identifying:

High-performing regions
High-profit products
Strong and weak categories
Monthly sales trends
Payment-method performance
High-sales/low-profit products
Discount and margin relationships
Loss-making areas

The final insights are based on the calculated Excel results rather than assumptions.

📈 Recommendations

Based on the analysis, management can:

Focus on high-profit products and categories.
Review high-discount transactions.
Investigate high-sales but low-margin products.
Improve performance in weaker regions.
Monitor low-margin categories.
Use monthly trends for future sales planning.
